      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭘 하고 있냐고?\n야생 가보리에게 먹이를 주고 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB580020D558ACE00020C788B0D0ACE0003F000AC57CC0DD0020AC00BCF4B9ACC5D0AC8C0020BA39C774B97C0020C8FCACE00020C788C5B4002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가보리는 철을 좋아해서\n내버려두면 자동차도 먹어 버리거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00BCF4B9ACB2940020CCA0C7440020C88BC544D574C11C000AB0B4BC84B824B450BA740020C790B3D9CC28B3C40020BA39C5B40020BC84B9ACAC70B4E0002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러는 걸 방지하기 위해\n이렇게 고철을 주고 있는 거야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2940020AC780020BC29C9C0D558AE300020C704D574000AC774B807AC8C0020ACE0CCA0C7440020C8FCACE00020C788B2940020AC70C57C002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 매번 고철만 줘서\n가보리들이 질려 할까 봐 걱정이란 말이지...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020B9E4BC880020ACE0CCA0B9CC0020C918C11C000AAC00BCF4B9ACB4E4C7740020C9C8B8240020D560AE4C0020BD100020AC71C815C774B7800020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 떠오른 건데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020B5A0C624B9780020AC74B370002E002E002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "독타입 기술로\n고철에 맛을 더하면 좋을 것 같지 않아!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3C5D0C0C7850020AE30C220B85C000AACE0CCA0C5D00020B9DBC7440020B354D558BA740020C88BC7440020AC830020AC19C9C00020C54AC5440021003F001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강철타입 포켓몬에게는\n독이 통하지 않으니까 걱정할 거 없어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15CCA0D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8CB294000AB3C5C7740020D1B5D558C9C00020C54AC73CB2C8AE4C0020AC71C815D5600020AC700020C5C6C5B40021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 고철 더미에 기술 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>오물폭탄<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>을 써서\n맛을 더해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
