      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑자기 떠오른 아이디어였는데\n좋아해 줘서 너무 기뻐!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C790AE300020B5A0C624B9780020C544C774B514C5B4C600B294B370000AC88BC544D5740020C918C11C0020B108BB340020AE30BED00021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "맛을 더하는 걸 도와줘서 정말 고마워!\n덕분에 많은 도움이 됐어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DBC7440020B354D558B2940020AC780020B3C4C640C918C11C0020C815B9D00020ACE0B9C8C6CC0021000AB355BD84C5D00020B9CEC7400020B3C4C6C0C7740020B410C5B40021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이제부터는 가보리들이 어떤 독타입 기술을\n가장 좋아하는지 조사해 볼 생각이야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774C81CBD80D130B2940020AC00BCF4B9ACB4E4C7740020C5B4B5A40020B3C5D0C0C7850020AE30C220C744000AAC00C7A50020C88BC544D558B294C9C00020C870C0ACD5740020BCFC0020C0DDAC01C774C57C002E001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가보리들아!\n앞으로도 고철을 잔뜩 먹게 해 줄게!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00BCF4B9ACB4E4C5440021000AC55EC73CB85CB3C40020ACE0CCA0C7440020C794B7290020BA39AC8C0020D5740020C904AC8C0021001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
